# Project specific
# Generated research artifacts (preflight reports, family reports, MVP
# summaries, promotion decision artifacts) live in artifacts/ and are
# deliberately NOT committed; CI evidence under artifacts/verification/ is
# the tracked exception.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/verification/
